{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/SQ","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/aggregate(vertexCount:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/levelFinished(_:modularity:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/move(_:from:to:gain:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each level starts with local moving: level vertices are taken in number order, sweep after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sweep, and each moves to the neighboring community that raises the modularity most, reported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as it moves. Communities are named by level vertex numbers. When a sweep moves nothing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level is finished, with its partition of the graph’s vertices and that partition’s modularity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the modularity rose by more than the threshold, the communities are then merged into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next level’s vertices, numbered by their labels in the partition just reported. At the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level the level vertices are the graph’s vertices, numbered in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order (their vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices when the graph has them). The method ends after a level whose modularity did not rise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough, or after an aggregation whose local moving moved nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"What the Louvain method reports, in order.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"CommunityDetection"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"LouvainEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvents.swift#L15"},"externalID":"s:18CommunityDetection12LouvainEventO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LouvainEvent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LouvainEvent"}],"role":"symbol","title":"LouvainEvent"},"references":{"doc://CommunityDetection/s9EscapableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s9EscapableP","title":"Swift.Escapable"},"doc://CommunityDetection/documentation/CommunityDetection/LouvainEvent/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"title":"CustomStringConvertible Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent\/customstringconvertible-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://CommunityDetection/documentation/CommunityDetection":{"abstract":[],"title":"CommunityDetection","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection","url":"\/documentation\/communitydetection","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://CommunityDetection/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://CommunityDetection/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://CommunityDetection/documentation/CommunityDetection/LouvainEvent/Equatable-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/Equatable-Implementations","kind":"article","title":"Equatable Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent\/equatable-implementations","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://CommunityDetection/documentation/Community